		<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
		<p class="subtitle">The agreement that governs your use of vectismail.com and any Vectis Mail&trade; subscription you take out.</p>
		<p style="color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); font-size: 0.95rem;"><strong>Effective:</strong> 17 May 2026 &middot; <strong>Last updated:</strong> 17 May 2026</p>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">1. What these terms cover (and what they don't)</h2>
		<p>These Terms of Service are an agreement between you and <strong>Veltara Works&trade;</strong>, the publisher of Vectis Mail. They cover:</p>
		<ul style="line-height: 1.8;">
			<li>Your visit to and use of <strong>vectismail.com</strong> (this marketing site, including the contact form and the billing-portal proxy at <code>/account/billing</code>).</li>
